  "description": "Popular idol Yooha in the 10th year of his debut. And your number one fan, Dohyeon.\n\nOne day, Yooha appears in front of Dohyeon's eyes and asks for help, but Dohyeon can't believe who she says she is. Because... 'Yooha is an IA that cannot exist in this world!'\n\nRomance full of secrets between a virtual idol and a smoking fan. Can these two wishes come true?!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=800400), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8890136)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0002798)",
